[31.703719, "o", "████████╗███╗   ███╗███████╗     ██████╗ ██████╗ ██████╗ ███████╗\r\n╚══██╔══╝████╗ ████║██╔════╝    ██╔════╝██╔═══██╗██╔══██╗██╔════╝\r\n   ██║   ██╔████╔██║█████╗█████╗██║     ██║   ██║██████╔╝█████╗  \r\n   ██║   ██║╚██╔╝██║██╔══╝╚════╝██║     ██║   ██║██╔══██╗██╔══╝  \r\n   ██║   ██║ ╚═╝ ██║███████╗    ╚██████╗╚██████╔╝██║  ██║███████╗\r\n   ╚═╝   ╚═╝     ╚═╝╚══════╝     ╚═════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝\r\n      "]
[31.703749, "o", "                                                           \r\n=================================================================\r\n              ✅ INSTALASI TME-CORE SELESAI!\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n👉 Langkah Selanjutnya:\r\n1. Edit kredensial Anda: nano .env\r\n2. Uji coba koneksi: source venv/bin/activate && python3 -m src.api.connection\r\n3. Atau Jalankan Langsung Engine: source venv/bin/activate && python3 -m src.main_engine\r\n========================================================================================\r\n\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;teungku@debian: ~/TME-CORE\u0007\u001b[01;32mteungku@debian\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/TME-CORE\u001b[00m$ "]
